HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E0_P0::
	.string "Picture a valley in JOHTO. Three\nthousand years ago, maybe more. No\lroads. No POKé BALLS.\pPeople come to the RUINS with\nchisels and lamps, and they carve\lthe same strange shapes into the\lwalls. Over and over.\pWhy? You don't spend a whole life\nin the dark on decoration.\pThey were writing something down.\nSomething they were afraid the\lworld would forget.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E0_P1::
	.string "Here's what keeps me up at night.\nThe shapes on those walls... move.\pThe UNOWN. Twenty-six of them,\nthen two more. Each one looks\lexactly like a letter on the wall.\pDid the people copy the POKéMON?\nOr did the POKéMON climb out of\lthe writing?\pThink about being the first person\nto watch a word peel itself off a\lstone and float away.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E0_P2::
	.string "Scholars spent a century on those\nwalls. The answer came from\lsomewhere nobody looked:\lthe radio.\pTune in near the RUINS and you\nhear a signal. It's the UNOWN.\lTalking. Or reading aloud.\pSome say the walls are a library,\nand the UNOWN are librarians who\lnever went home.\pAnd if they're still reading...\nwho are they reading to?$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E1_P0::
	.string "ECRUTEAK. Two towers, built to\nface each other across the town.\lThe BRASS TOWER and the TIN TOWER.\pThey weren't built for show. They\nwere meant as a meeting place\lbetween people and POKéMON.\pFor about a hundred and fifty\nyears, it worked. A great rainbow\lbird roosted on the BRASS TOWER.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E1_P1::
	.string "Then one night, lightning. Some\nsay it was only a storm. Some say\lit wasn't.\pThe tower burned for three days.\nImagine standing in the street,\lwatching the beams come down.\pThree POKéMON were caught inside.\nNo names. Nobody would ever have\lremembered them.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E1_P2::
	.string "When the rain finally came, a\nrainbow-colored POKéMON came down\lout of it.\pIt brought the three back. Not as\nthey were. As something new:\lthunder, fire and the north wind.\pThen it flew off, and it never\ncame back to the BRASS TOWER. Who\lcould blame it?\pWe call the three RAIKOU, ENTEI\nand SUICUNE. They're still\lrunning. Maybe they're still\llooking for it.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E1_Teaser::
	.string "Next week: a tower, a storm, and\nthree POKéMON nobody would ever\lhave remembered.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E2_P0::
	.string "Go back further. Before towns.\nBefore people. HOENN was only land\land sea, and each had a master.\pGROUDON raised the land. KYOGRE\nfilled the sea.\pAnd neither one thought the other\nhad any business existing.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E2_P1::
	.string "So they fought. Not like a POKéMON\nbattle. Like weather.\pDrought that split the rock in\ntwo. Rain that never,\lever stopped.\pSay you're alive back then, on\nsome little ledge of land. Which\lone do you pray for?\pThink about it. Either answer\ndrowns somebody.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E2_P2::
	.string "It ended from above. A green\nserpent came down out of the sky\land roared until both of\lthem stopped.\pRAYQUAZA. It didn't win. It just\nended the fight. The two of them\lwent to sleep, under the earth and\lunder the sea.\pLook at a map of HOENN, {PLAYER}.\nEvery coastline is the place they\lstopped. It's a map of a truce.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E2_Teaser::
	.string "Next week we go further back than\nanyone was there to see. Land\lagainst sea.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E3_P0::
	.string "Far from here there's a land\ncalled KALOS. Three thousand years\lago, it was at war.\pA king there had a POKéMON he\nloved more than anything.\pIt was taken from him to fight. It\nnever came home.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E3_P1::
	.string "The king couldn't accept it. He\nbuilt a machine to bring it back\lto life. And it worked.\pBut grief is never satisfied. He\nturned the machine into a weapon.\lAnd he used it.\pIt ended the war. It ended\neveryone on both sides of the war.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E3_P2::
	.string "The story says the POKéMON he\nsaved left him once it saw what\lhe'd done.\pThink about that. To save one life\nyou love, you burn a whole\lcountry. And the one you saved\lcan't look at you.\pThe king, they say, is still alive\nsomewhere. Still waiting. I hope\lthat part isn't true.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E3_Teaser::
	.string "Next week: a land far from here, a\nking, and a grief so big it ended\la war.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E4_P0::
	.string "Every people has a story of how\nthe world began. JOHTO's oldest\lone is carved at the SINJOH RUINS.\pBefore anything, there was an egg.\nOut of the egg came one POKéMON.\lThe carvings give it a\lthousand arms.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E4_P1::
	.string "It made time, and space. And a\nthird thing nobody likes to talk\labout: whatever is on the\lother side.\pThree dragons. Then the spirits of\nthe lakes, of knowledge and\lfeeling and will.\pThen it went to sleep. Its work\nwas done.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E4_P2::
	.string "But read the carvings closely and\nthey say something more. It made\lpeople a promise.\pIt would come back one day, to see\nwhat the world had made of itself.\pImagine being the one standing\nthere when it opens its eyes. What\ldo you say to the one who\lmade everything?$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E4_Teaser::
	.string "Next week we start before anything\nstarted at all. Bring a snack.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E5_P0::
	.string "Let's come closer to home. Living\nmemory. TEAM ROCKET.\pIt started under the GAME CORNER\nin CELADON. A boss with a big\lplan, and an even bigger\lorganization behind him.\pStolen POKéMON. Experiments. They\neven took SILPH CO. by force.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E5_P1::
	.string "And who stopped them? Not the\npolice. Not the LEAGUE. A kid from\lPALLET TOWN with a POKéDEX.\pThe boss was a GYM LEADER, if you\ncan believe it. He lost, and he\lwalked away.\pHis team didn't. Years later they\ntook over the RADIO TOWER in\lGOLDENROD and called for him on\lthe air.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E5_P2::
	.string "He never answered. Some say he\nheard and chose not to.\pThen another kid stopped them all\nover again. A kid from NEW BARK\lTOWN. Sound familiar, {PLAYER}?\pHistory isn't only old stones.\nSomeday somebody will tell your\lstory on the radio.\pWhat do you want them to say?$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_E5_Teaser::
	.string "Next week, the last one: a story\nyou might know better than I do.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_Outro::
	.string "That's every story I've got.\nFor now.\pHistory keeps happening, {PLAYER}.\nMostly to people like you. I'll be\lhere when there's more to tell.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Dan_Intro::
	.string "Oh! A visitor. Come in, come in.\nThe name's DAN.\pI tell stories. Old ones. The kind\nthat happened to real people and\lreal POKéMON, who had no idea\lanyone would ever remember them.\pI do a show on the radio, THE DEEP\nPAST. But I like telling it to\lsomebody's face better.\pOne story a week, a piece at a\ntime. Ready? Let's begin.$"

