	.string "{PLAYER}! It's BRENDAN.\pDo you ever listen to THE DEEP\nPAST? The history show, on the\lradio here in KANTO.\pMAY and I had it on in PEWTER, and\nthe host, DAN, said a trainer from\lJOHTO comes by the MUSEUM every\lweek to hear his stories.\pThat's you, right? I knew it! Tell\nhim to do one about HOENN's gyms\lnext. Bye!$"
